d":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n- Can't test with previous versions as the feature is introduced in v4.6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.11 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you set an icon for any tab in TabContainer inside the editor, the project runs ok within the editor.\nBut when you export the project (I can only test in windows), the icon is not shown when the project exe is run.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Setup a TabContainer with icons for tabs within editor (not with the code)\n- Export project with windows template (This is cruicial as you don't see the issue when you run the project inside the editor)\n- Run Project exe\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[debug-5.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25343717/debug-5.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.